        "payload": "tree 5c19c9b0ca35e03f7ecbbbf4d8ab4687145799ec\nparent 05bc2f53ce0cb239c17dbdd6b261bd2db7d2a940\nauthor Bruce0X <109469941+Bruce039@users.noreply.github.com> 1790605364 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790605364 -0300\n\nbitcoin-tx: reject outscript with too many separators\n\noutscript takes VALUE:SCRIPT[:FLAGS], but the flags are only read when\nthere are exactly three fields. With an extra ':' the flags are\nsilently ignored, so `outscript=0:1:S:` produces a bare script output\ninstead of the requested P2SH (or P2WSH for W) and exits 0.\n\nReject more than three fields with the same error that outpubkey and\noutaddr already use.",
